RainbowBarrels is an unofficial Darktide mod and is not affiliated with
Fatshark or Games Workshop. Warhammer 40,000 and Darktide and their game
resources belong to their respective rights holders.

The installer reconstructs modified resources from an authenticated, supported
stock Darktide installation and custom additions. The release does not
include complete extracted stock game bundles, the game decoder, the game
executable, Darktide Mod Loader, Darktide Mod Framework, or LuaExec.
